  "prefLabel": "Rev 2504.02 Interest and Dividends Tax",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2504.02 Interest and Dividends Tax. Interest and dividend taxpayers may remit payments electronically through the ACH debit method by accessing the department’s Granite Tax Connect web portal at gtc.revenue.nh.gov.\n\nSource. #10484, eff 12-5-13 (from Rev 2505.02); ss by #13724, eff 8-18-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 2500)",
